InitialConnection: `4`
ClientReason: `ThirdPartyBlocked`
ProtocolConstant: `THIRD_PARTY_BLOCKED`

This error appears when your Minecraft server has been blacklisted. Please see [Mojang's guide](https://help.minecraft.net/hc/en-us/articles/4409161646989).